","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_53","text":"Anyway, you seem to be onto something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_54","text":"All the eggs are rather neatly arranged.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_55","text":"They seem to be separated into zones according to size and shape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_56","text":"Small eggs on the right, larger ones in the center, and... unusually shaped ones on the left.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_57","text":"The texture, shape, and color of the shells on the left are different from the others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_58","text":"These eggs were almost certainly sorted and arranged with intention.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_06_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_06_s_59","text":"But didn't Leviathan say that she had stopped bei